<para>
  <classname>GrayColor</classname> is a variety of <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-OpaqueColor"/> that can only represent
  shades of gray.  <varname>value</varname> is a floating point number
  between 0 and 1, inclusive, where 0 is black and 1 is white.
</para>
<para>
  <classname>GrayColor</classname>(x) is equivalent to <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-RGBColor"/>(x,x,x).
</para>

